// [@://nsible_os/assets/.gzl/osColors.gzl/.-={
// module: "Color Protocol Library & Translator",
// version: "1.6.0",
// description: "System-mapped spectral map with integrated shims.",
// changes: "Injected @nsible-specific data_objects and controllable variables.",
// philotic_inferences: "A variable is only as true as the state it enforces."

>> INITIATE: DEFINITION_MATRIX [MODE: COLOR_PROTOCOL]

!! CONSTRAINTS:
- IMMUTABLE_DEFINITIONS == TRUE
- NO_SEMANTIC_DRIFT == TRUE

== DEFINE $CRIMSON [DOMAIN: BIOLOGICAL]:
- HIGH_HEX: 0x00FF003C | HIGH_ANSI: \033[38;2;255;0;60m
- STD_HEX:  0x00DC143C | STD_ANSI:  \033[38;2;220;20;60m
- VARIABLES: @aud.state.io.vis_data, @sys.host_id_len, @kernel.thread_mortality, @resource.scarcity_index.
- @NSIBLE_STATE: Base-Reality. The flesh and blood cost. Non-negotiable physical limits.

== DEFINE $SILVER [DOMAIN: SYSTEMIC]:
- HIGH_HEX: 0x00DCDCDC | HIGH_ANSI: \033[38;2;220;220;220m
- STD_HEX:  0x00AAAAAA | STD_ANSI:  \033[38;2;170;170;170m
- VARIABLES: @ziGGit.rebase_flag, @net.vinculum_key, @assets.void_link_status, @supply.lattice_integrity.
- @NSIBLE_STATE: The Grid. Sterile, calculating, and indifferent to biological cost.

== DEFINE $BRASS [DOMAIN: ANTHROPOLOGICAL]:
- HIGH_HEX: 0x00FFD700 | HIGH_ANSI: \033[38;2;255;215;0m
- STD_HEX:  0x00FFBF00 | STD_ANSI:  \033[38;2;255;191;0m
- VARIABLES: @zen.card_sub_status, @ruse.consensus_metric, @philotic.web_sync_pos, @beh.cycle_friction.
- @NSIBLE_STATE: Anthropological. Mapping the friction of human interaction and consensus reality.

== DEFINE $BLACK [DOMAIN: ENTROPIC]:
- HIGH_HEX: 0x001A1A1A | HIGH_ANSI: \033[38;2;26;26;26m
- STD_HEX:  0x00000000 | STD_ANSI:  \033[38;2;0;0;0m
- VARIABLES: @void.trail_tome_size, @kernel.fatal_exception_count, @arch.decay_pivot_1973, @shadow.data_overflow.
- @NSIBLE_STATE: Deep-Archival. Diagnostic extraction of the signal from the noise.

// }-.]
